{
  "_note": "生成器 tools/infosource/gen_headlines.py(v2ex · 5 槽)。组件 .df **不缓存**(G23 契约 5)。只取标题 / 数字 / 标签 / 时间,正文字段一律不进输出(§3.13)。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tzNow",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "action": "request",
      "id": "resp",
      "params": {
        "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/api/topics/hot.json",
        "method": "GET",
        "formatType": "json"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[0].title}),0),0,1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "error",
          "params": {
            "errorMsg": "v2ex_unreachable"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "取数失败 → 抛错终止流,平台据此回落上次成功数据(G26/§7.2)"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "at",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${tzNow},HH:mm)]"
      },
      "_note": "榜单没有「数据时间」字段,用取数时刻兜底(标准 §4.4)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "reNL",
        "value": "([^\r\n])[ \t]*[\r\n]+[ \t]*([^\r\n])"
      },
      "_note": "标题清洗用的正则(见生成器 NL_RE 注释)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rpNL",
        "value": "$1 $2"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "reTl",
        "value": "[ ]+[^ ]*$"
      },
      "_note": "截断后退到上一个词边界(英文)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "reTp",
        "value": "[-,;:.–—/ ]+$"
      },
      "_note": "截断处的句尾标点 / 空格剥掉再补省略号。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "reAs",
        "value": "[ -~]"
      },
      "_note": "可打印 ASCII —— 剥掉它们剩下的就是宽字符(中日韩)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_vs",
        "value": [
          "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[0].replies},0)]",
          "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[1].replies},0)]",
          "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[2].replies},0)]",
          "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[3].replies},0)]",
          "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[4].replies},0)]",
          "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[5].replies},0)]",
          "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[6].replies},0)]",
          "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[7].replies},0)]",
          "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[8].replies},0)]",
          "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[9].replies},0)]"
        ]
      },
      "_note": "热度候选池(前 10 条)的分数。⚠️ 必须是真数组字面量(sum/max 拿到串会静默求空)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "vmax",
        "value": "$[max::(calc::(max::(${_vs})),1)]"
      },
      "_note": "归一分母 = 候选池峰值,下限 1(全 0 时除零 → 条宽非数 → 整个组件渲不出)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r0",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(replaceAll::(${resp[0].title},${reNL},${rpNL}),${reNL},${rpNL})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t0L",
        "value": "$[length::(${r0})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t0N",
        "value": "$[length::(replaceAll::(${r0},${reAs},))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t0W",
        "value": "$[round::(calc::(${t0L}+${t0N}))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t0K",
        "value": "$[round::(min::(floor::(calc::(${t0L}*80/max::(${t0W},1))),${t0L}))]"
      },
      "_note": "截到第几个字:按本条的平均字宽把预算折成字数。round 是为了 Android 上 floor 返回 double。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t0",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${t0W},80),connect::(replaceAll::(subString::(${r0},0,${t0K}),${reTp},),…),${r0})]"
      },
      "_note": "超出 80 个宽度单位才截:按词退一格、剥句尾标点、补「…」(线上宿主的文本节点出不了省略号)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "l0",
        "value": "$[if::(le::(${t0W},36),1,2)]"
      },
      "_note": "标题估计排几行:1 行时行内内容整体居中(条 / meta 不在标题下面空出一行)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "s0",
        "value": "${resp[0].replies}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "gr0",
        "value": "$[if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),${resp[0].node.title},findNotEmpty::(${resp[0].node.title_alternative},${resp[0].node.title}))]"
      },
      "_note": "标签:V2EX 节点中文界面用中文名、其余用接口自带的英文名(title_alternative,doc/overseas-first.md §2);HF 是机构,缺了退第一作者。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "g0L",
        "value": "$[length::(${gr0})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "g0N",
        "value": "$[length::(replaceAll::(${gr0},${reAs},))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "g0W",
        "value": "$[round::(calc::(${g0L}+${g0N}))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "g0K",
        "value": "$[round::(min::(floor::(calc::(${g0L}*24/max::(${g0W},1))),${g0L}))]"
      },
      "_note": "截到第几个字:按本条的平均字宽把预算折成字数。round 是为了 Android 上 floor 返回 double。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "g0",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${g0W},24),connect::(replaceAll::(replaceAll::(subString::(${gr0},0,${g0K}),${reTl},),${reTp},),…),${gr0})]"
      },
      "_note": "标签压到一行放得下(「Zhejiang University」→「Zhejiang…」)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "b0",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(max::(calc::(findNotEmpty::(${s0},0)*1.25*70.0/(findNotEmpty::(${s0},0)+${vmax}/4)),6),0.0)]"
      },
      "_note": "条宽(像素)= 饱和比例 f(v)=1.25·v/(v+峰值/4):f(峰值)=1、f(峰值/4)=0.625 —— 与 √ 一样把挤在低端的大多数摊开(线性比例下第 2 名以后常常只剩几个像素),又不需要开方。下限 6 = 一个圆头直径。70.0 与 .rcn 逐字对应。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "am0",
        "value": "$[max::(floor::(calc::((${tzNow}/1000-${resp[0].created})/60)),1)]"
      },
      "_note": "发帖距今分钟数(`created` 是秒级时间戳)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "a0",
        "value": "$[round::(if::(lt::(${am0},60),${am0},if::(lt::(${am0},2880),floor::(calc::(${am0}/60)),floor::(calc::(${am0}/1440)))))]"
      },
      "_note": "显示用数字一律 round:Android 上 floor/calc 返回 double,会渲成「5.0」。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "u0",
        "value": "$[if::(lt::(${am0},60),1,if::(lt::(${am0},2880),2,3))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "r1",
        "value": "$[replaceAll::(replaceAll::(${resp[1].title},${reNL},${rpNL}),${reNL},${rpNL})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t1L",
        "value": "$[length::(${r1})]"
      }
    },
